|---|---|---|
| Read source / config file | Read tool | `cat`, `head`, `tail`, `rtk read` |
| Read large log / build output | `rtk read <file>` or `rtk log <file>` | bare `cat` |
| Search in files | Grep tool | bare `grep` / `rg` in Bash |
| All other shell commands | `rtk <cmd>` (hook auto-applies) | bare command |
```

**Change B** — Fix L33 (current: "use the Read tool or `rtk read`"):

```diff
-**Never use plain `cat` in Bash** — use the Read tool or `rtk read`.
+**Never use plain `cat` in Bash** — use the Read tool for source files.
```

**Change C** — Replace `## Hook Status` block at end of file:

```markdown
## Hook Status (this machine)

```
[ok] PreToolUse hook: ACTIVE — rtk-prerewrite.js auto-rewrites every Bash call
[ok] Manual prefix: still valid; use RTK_DISABLED=1 <cmd> to bypass per-command
