-  does not register one, and discipline-based `rtk` prefixing is the only mechanism
-  (see AGENTS.md "RTK" + "Self-Check"). Project-level output filters live in `.rtk/filters.toml`
-  (trusted) and apply only when commands are invoked via `rtk`.
